{"nodes":[{"id":"a7b1c1d1e1f10001","type":"text","text":"# Linux计划任务\n\n**模块说明**：crontab/at/anacrontab 定时调度\n\n— 1 个笔记 —","x":-110,"y":-200,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"4"},{"id":"a7b1c1d1e1f10002","type":"file","file":"cron.md","x":-130,"y":-50,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a7b1c1d1e1f10003","type":"text","text":"cron.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型：计划任务 = 闹钟\n• §1 cron vs at vs anacron\n• §2 crontab 用户级\n• §3 crontab 时间格式\n• §4 crontab 特殊字符\n• §5 crontab 环境变量\n• §6 crontab 实战\n• §7 crontab -u\n• §8 crontab 文件名加载\n• §9 crond 系统级\n• §10 /etc/cron.d/\n• §11 /etc/cron.{hourly,daily,weekly,monthly}\n• §12 anacrontab\n• §13 at 一次性任务\n• §14 at 时间格式\n• §15 atq / atrm / at -c\n• §16 at 黑白名单\n• §17 实战：3 个 cron + 2 个 at\n• §18 速查表\n• §19 易错点\n• §20 面试追问\n• §21 链路","x":200,"y":-200,"width":380,"height":505}],"edges":[{"id":"e7b1c1d1e1f10001","fromNode":"a7b1c1d1e1f10001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a7b1c1d1e1f10002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e7b1c1d1e1f10002","fromNode":"a7b1c1d1e1f10002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a7b1c1d1e1f10003","toSide":"left"}]}
